flowchart LR
    %% Data Flow Diagram for Option 2: Federated ACL with REST Proxy
    
    subgraph Velocity Domain [🟩 Velocity Bounded Context]
        direction TB
        V_App[Velocity Origination App <br/> .NET / Angular]
        V_Topic[(Velocity Native <br/> Kafka Topic)]
        V_ACL[[Velocity Translator ACL <br/> .NET Microservice]]
        
        V_App -->|1. Publishes Fat Event| V_Topic
        V_Topic -->|2. Consumes Native Event| V_ACL
    end

    subgraph Mosaic Domain [🟦 Mosaic Bounded Context]
        direction TB
        M_App[Mosaic Servicing App <br/> Spring Boot / Flowable]
        M_Topic[(Mosaic Native <br/> Kafka Topic)]
        M_ACL[[Mosaic Translator ACL <br/> Spring Boot Microservice]]
        
        M_App -->|1. Publishes Fat Event| M_Topic
        M_Topic -->|2. Consumes Native Event| M_ACL
    end

    subgraph Data Domain [🟧 Enterprise Data Domain]
        direction TB
        HubProxy[InteractionHub <br/> Kafka REST Proxy]
        EntTopic[(Enterprise Canonical <br/> Kafka Topic)]
        ODS[(Enterprise ODS)]
        
        HubProxy -->|4. Produces Record to| EntTopic
        EntTopic -->|5. Ingests via Sink Connector| ODS
    end

    %% Cross-Domain Translation Flows - Removed parentheses and breaks for safe parsing
    V_ACL -->|3. HTTP POST Canonical JSON| HubProxy
    M_ACL -->|3. HTTP POST Canonical JSON| HubProxy

